nt.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP03", "case": "before-completion contrast", "input": "BP01 collision exists, observe before elapsed motion threshold, no extra updates or writes.", "expected": "Bump count committed, global/repel unchanged; do not move completion-side effects to collision creation.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP04", "case": "touch-success suppresses collision", "input": "Blocked cardinal attempt; player touch check succeeds and starts a valid event; no preexisting motion or extra state writes.", "expected": "Collision creation branch is not taken; this request does not create the collision completion/step chain. Event effects and later unrelated updates are separate.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP05", "case": "failed diagonal contrast", "input": "BP01 but one fixed segment of a direct diagonal request is blocked; no preexisting motion; direction-fix false.", "expected": "Direction may change, but no collision timer/count and no completion step from this attempt. Do not generalize from cardinal collision to every failed move.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP06", "case": "forced-route completion contrast", "input": "BP01 collision under forced player route with following WAIT keeping forcing true through collision completion; no automatic terrain or interruption.", "expected": "Collision count still committed; general completion notification and forced player early branch apply, but no global/player-cycle/repel advance. Existing MR02 state-based route advancement remains correct.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP07", "case": "failure after partial commit", "input": "BP01, but at completion the first general-step consumer deterministically raises before returning; no mutation by that failing consumer.", "expected": "Collision count already B+1 and movement timer already cleared. Player step phase is not reached, so no global/repel increment; no rollback or gam